## Hosted vs self-host

Official deployment: https://www.voterr.tv/ (hosted; host uses Plex OAuth).
Self-host: clone https://github.com/wheresfrank/voterr, bundle, PostgreSQL, `rails server`. See the README.

## Not in scope

Voterr does not replace Plex, Radarr, or Sonarr. It does not scrape other people’s libraries. It does not require guests to have Plex accounts.
